This repository contains Flutter application source, project documentation,
and native source for the Piper Plus TTS warmup path and local LLM bridges.

Limited beta builds may bundle local models, dictionaries, and runtime
libraries recorded in `distribution/model_manifest.yaml`, including
ReazonSpeech, Silero VAD, OpenCV YuNet/SFace, CAM++ / 3D-Speaker, OpenJTalk
dictionary files, Piper Plus dictionary data, and LiteRT-LM runtime libraries.
Their notices are consolidated in the in-app Licenses page under
"StackChan Pet Talk".

The optional Piper Plus robot-style voice effect uses WORLD under its modified
BSD license. Its full notice is included in the app's license information.
